--
cvise reduction of cpp20_map_basic's last layer: the piecewise pair
construction chain (delegating ctor + _Index_tuple pack-expansion
mem-init) loses the constructed value; the operator[] reference lands
at offset 12 instead of 4.  All pointer checks stay green -- pure
value corruption.

FIXED 2026-07-19: C++20 parenthesized aggregate initialization (P0960)
implemented as constructor-first fallback, plus deleted-implicit-
default-constructor semantics ([class.default.ctor]/2) so classes with
a non-default-constructible base convert at all.
